      "rendered": "http://wisequest.org/2025/12/24/mohammad-peace-blessings-be-upon-him/"
    },
    "modified": "2025-12-24T23:26:48",
    "modified_gmt": "2025-12-25T07:26:48",
    "slug": "mohammad-peace-blessings-be-upon-him",
    "status": "publish",
    "type": "post",
    "link": "https://wisequest.home.blog/2025/12/24/mohammad-peace-blessings-be-upon-him/",
    "title": {
      "rendered": "Mohammad peace &amp; blessings be upon&nbsp;him"
    },
    "content": {
      "rendered": "\n<figure class=\"wp-block-pullquote\"><blockquote><p>Who are the biggest influences in your life?</p></blockquote></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Prophet Muhammad (peace be upon him) transformed not only my life, but the lives of billions by offering clear guidance, profound mercy, and a complete moral framework rooted in justice, compassion, and accountability. Through his character and teachings, he uplifted the oppressed, established care for the poor and vulnerable, promoted honesty, family values, and social responsibility, and inspired lasting spiritual and ethical reform across societies. His unparalleled influence is widely recognized—most notably by historian Michael H. Hart, who ranked Prophet Muhammad first on his list of The 100: A Ranking of the Most Influential Persons in History, citing his unique success in shaping both religious belief and worldly affairs.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"683\" height=\"1024\" data-attachment-id=\"2864\" data-permalink=\"https://wisequest.home.blog/pexels-photo-7698078/\" data-orig-file=\"https://idialoguehome.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/pexels-photo-7698078.jpeg\" data-orig-size=\"867,1300\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"close up shot of patterns on a wall\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://idialoguehome.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/pexels-photo-7698078.jpeg?w=683\" src=\"https://idialoguehome.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/pexels-photo-7698078.jpeg?w=683\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2864\" srcset=\"https://idialoguehome.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/pexels-photo-7698078.jpeg?w=683 683w, https://idialoguehome.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/pexels-photo-7698078.jpeg?w=100 100w, https://idialoguehome.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/pexels-photo-7698078.jpeg?w=200 200w, https://idialoguehome.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/pexels-photo-7698078.jpeg?w=768 768w, https://idialoguehome.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/pexels-photo-7698078.jpeg 867w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 683px) 100vw, 683px\" /></figure>\n",
      "protected": false
    },
    "excerpt": {
      "rendered": "<p>Who are the biggest influences in your life? Prophet Muhammad (peace be upon him) transformed not only my life, but the lives of billions by offering clear guidance, profound mercy, and a complete moral framework rooted in justice, compassion, and accountability. Through his character and teachings, he uplifted the oppressed, established care for the poor &hellip; <a href=\"https://wisequest.home.blog/2025/12/24/mohammad-peace-blessings-be-upon-him/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Mohammad peace &amp; blessings be upon&nbsp;him</span> <span class=\"meta-nav\">&rarr;</span></a></p>\n",
